// self-host-v2 / severity.scrml — GENERATED by scripts/gen-bootstrap-severity.ts
// from SPEC §34's catalog. DO NOT EDIT: run `bun scripts/gen-bootstrap-severity.ts`.
// (CI tracking runs `--check`; severity.test.js checks every answer against §34.)
//
// §34 (S451): "A code whose Severity column reads **Error** fails the compile, and
// a compile that reports one SHALL NOT produce a runnable artifact (§2.2.1).
// **Warning** and **Info** codes do not fail the compile."
//
// A diagnostic's severity is its CODE's §34 row — never a call site's choice:
// ast.scrml `newDiag` is the one Diag constructor and reads `severityOf`. The
// code's prefix is not the severity (§34 makes E-DG-002 a Warning, many W- Info).
//
// 112 codes with a §34 severity; 69 without one (FAIL-CLOSED Error):
//   E-ASSIGN-CONST — no §34 row
